unts\n• Hints mode shows the equation, so young players never get stuck\n\nRace, swap, and outsmart\n• Land on a lone rival to swap it back to the start\n• Keep two pawns side-by-side to stay safe\n• Dodge the House of Water — it sends you back to square 15!\n\nTwo ways to play\n• 2-player pass-and-play on one tablet\n• Solo vs a friendly computer — Easy, Medium, or Hard\n\nMade for families\n• 100% offline — play anywhere, no Wi-Fi needed\n• No ads. No in-app purchases. No accounts. No data collected. Ever.\n• Big, tappable pieces and clear numbers\n• Beautiful hand-illustrated Ancient-Egypt art\n• Plays in 11 languages: English, 中文, हिन्दी, Español, العربية, Français, বাংলা, Português, Bahasa Indonesia, Tiếng Việt, اردو\n\nGreat for ages 5+, classrooms, and anyone who loves a quick, clever board game. Part of the Math Duel family of kid-friendly, offline learning games.", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "sellerUrl": "https://htphuc1994.github.io/mathduel-site/", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "fileSizeBytes": "13182976", "averageUserRating": 0, "formattedPrice": "￦1,100", "minimumOsVersion": "14.0", "trackId": 6787401851, "trackName": "Senet: Pharaoh's Race", "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2026-07-10T22:24:52Z", "userRatingCount": 0}]}